{
  "info": {
    "name": "SkillSwap API",
    "description": "Run \"Auth / Login\" first: it stores the JWT in the {{token}} variable. Admin login: admin@skillswap.com. Register first (Gmail address, date of birth, strong password) or use the admin login.",
